{"id":2222,"date":"2025-06-03T10:44:07","date_gmt":"2025-06-03T15:44:07","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.arkhamhorror.com\/?post_type=news&#038;p=2222"},"modified":"2025-06-03T10:55:23","modified_gmt":"2025-06-03T15:55:23","slug":"the-tides-of-innsmouth-is-available-now","status":"publish","type":"news","link":"https:\/\/www.arkhamhorror.com\/news\/the-tides-of-innsmouth-is-available-now\/","title":{"rendered":"The Tides of Innsmouth is available now!"},"content":{"rendered":"\n<p><em>The Tides of Innsmouth<\/em>, the second book in the Arkham Horror Investigators Gamebooks series from Aconyte Books, is available now! Available in both print and ebook editions, pick up a copy from your usual bookseller or find a retailer <a href=\"https:\/\/books2read.com\/tidesofinnsmouth\/\">here<\/a>. <\/p>\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-image\">\n<figure class=\"aligncenter size-medium\"><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/cdn.svc.asmodee.net\/production-arkhamhorror\/uploads\/image-converter\/2025\/05\/ARKGB02-The-Tides-of-Innsmouth-hi-res_3D_03_paperback_spine-172x300.webp\" alt=\"The Tides of Innsmouth - 3D paperback\" class=\"wp-image-2106\"\/><\/figure><\/div>\n\n\n<p>To get you started on this latest adventure right away, we&#8217;ve pulled together all the downloads you could possibly need to play.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>Below you&#8217;ll find downloadable character sheets for the three Investigators making their gamebook debuts in <em>The Tides of Innsmouth<\/em> \u2013 Silas Marsh, Marion Tavares and K\u014dhaku Narukami. Each Investigator&#8217;s character sheet is available to download in two formats, one optimised for print (if you prefer to keep a paper copy stuffed between the pages of your gamebook) and an interactive PDF version, which you can save to your phone or your tablet to track your progress digitally.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>You&#8217;ll also find character sheets for the three Investigators who appeared in the first book, <em>The Darkness Over Arkham<\/em> \u2013&nbsp;namely, Agnes Baker, Rex Murphy and Nathaniel Cho \u2013 along with the three free downloadable investigators released so far \u2013 Stella Clark, Amanda Sharpe and Skids O&#8217;Toole.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>All of these Investigators are compatible with book of the books published in the series so far (and will be with future volumes, too) so you can play through <em>The Tides of Innsmouth<\/em> with your choice of any of these Investigators. (You can even go back and replay <em><a href=\"https:\/\/www.arkhamhorror.com\/books\/the-darkness-over-arkham\/\">The Darkness Over Arkham<\/a><\/em> with a new Investigator such as Silas Marsh for a whole new challenge.)<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>You&#8217;ll also find blank versions of the character sheet available to download, in both print and interactive forms, should you prefer to start afresh and get to know your chosen Investigator by copying over the details yourself.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>And, to mark the release of the book, we&#8217;re also delighted to reveal a new downloadable investigator, George Barnaby! Scroll down to check him out. <\/p>\n\n\n<div class=\"lazyblock-separator-esQmc wp-block-lazyblock-separator\"><div class=\"w-full h-px\"\n     style=\"background: linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.00) 0%, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.50) 50%, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.00) 100%);\"><\/div><\/div>\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"h-the-tides-of-innsmouth\">The Tides of Innsmouth<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-is-layout-1 wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\"><div class=\"lazyblock-texte-Z24zK5k wp-block-lazyblock-texte\">\n<section class=\"container mx-auto py-12 simple-image\">\n            <div class=\"max-w-xl mx-auto px-4\">\n            <div class=\"prose prose-lg space-y-[40px]\">\n                <h3 style=\"text-align: center;\">Silas Marsh<\/h3>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img loading